From: vyos-ls1046a-build CI <ci@local>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dpaa: FMan capability detection + CC stub (DT probe, productive structs)

Consolidates 0086 (fman-caps-detection-and-cc-stub) + 0086a
(fman-caps-probe-dt) + 0086b (fman-cc-productive-structs) into one patch,
verified byte-identical against CI checkpoints 577747604142..58c525b887e9
(patch-series-cleanup run 34556757795).
Touches: Kconfig, Makefile, dpaa_eth.{c,h}, dpaa_ethtool.c,
dpaa_fman_caps.{c,h}.

Signed-off-by: vyos-ls1046a-build CI <ci@local>
---
